{"id":"ec3012ebbfa291bf","group":"89","path":"89/89-df-first-order-formula.md","title":"First-Order Syntax and Capture-Avoiding Substitution","display":"df-first-order-formula — First-Order Syntax and Capture-Avoiding Substitution","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"The Logic of Provability","book_abbrev":"89","label":"89-df-first-order-formula","aliases":["89-df-first-order-formula"],"display":"df-first-order-formula — First-Order Syntax and Capture-Avoiding Substitution","depends_on":["[[89-df-function]]","[[89-df-omega]]"],"created":"2026-10-09"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"The Logic of Provability"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"89"},{"key":"label","html":"89-df-first-order-formula"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>89-df-first-order-formula</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-first-order-formula — First-Order Syntax and Capture-Avoiding Substitution"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"0d71e87a2f416230\" href=\"?note=0d71e87a2f416230\" title=\"89-df-function\">89-df-function</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"7ad117274f74965a\" href=\"?note=7ad117274f74965a\" title=\"89-df-omega\">89-df-omega</a></span></div>"},{"key":"created","html":"2026-10-09"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal L=(C,F,a_F,P,a_P)\">\\(\\mathcal L=(C,F,a_F,P,a_P)\\)</span> 是可数一阶签名；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a_F:F\\to\\omega\">\\(a_F:F\\to\\omega\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a_P:P\\to\\omega\">\\(a_P:P\\to\\omega\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C,F,P\">\\(C,F,P\\)</span> 与变量集 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf V=\\{v_i\\mid i\\in\\omega\\}\">\\(\\mathsf V=\\{v_i\\mid i\\in\\omega\\}\\)</span> 互不相交。所有语法构造子均为单射，像两两不交。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>原始逻辑构造子为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\neg,\\lor,\\forall\">\\(\\neg,\\lor,\\forall\\)</span>，等号为逻辑等号；沿用原文件的经典缩写。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\rho:\\mathsf V\\to\\mathrm{Trm}_S(\\mathcal L)\">\\(\\rho:\\mathsf V\\to\\mathrm{Trm}_S(\\mathcal L)\\)</span> 有有限非平凡支集。所有递归以有限语法树为域。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{AV}\">\\(\\mathsf{AV}\\)</span> 记录全部出现变量（包括绑定变量）；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\rho[x\\mapsto t]\">\\(\\rho[x\\mapsto t]\\)</span> 为函数的单点更新。公式构造中的变量取 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf V\">\\(\\mathsf V\\)</span>，项、公式分别取下述集合。向量替换中 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"|\\vec x|=|\\vec t|\">\\(|\\vec x|=|\\vec t|\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\vec x\">\\(\\vec x\\)</span> 的元素互异。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>补充接口中 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"U\">\\(U\\)</span> 为有限变量集，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k\\in\\omega\">\\(k\\in\\omega\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\vec x\">\\(\\vec x\\)</span> 是互异变量的有限序列，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\vec t\">\\(\\vec t\\)</span> 是等长项序列。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"E[t/x]\">\\(E[t/x]\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"E[x:=t]\">\\(E[x:=t]\\)</span> 均为同一避免捕获替换；同时替换不得改作逐项顺序替换。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}first\\text{-}order\\text{-}formula}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\nT_0&amp;\\coloneqq\\mathsf V\\cup C,\\quad\nT_{n+1}\\coloneqq T_n\\cup\\{f(t_0,\\ldots,t_{k-1})\\mid f\\in F,\\ k=a_F(f),\\ \\vec t\\in T_n^k\\},\\\\\n\\mathrm{Trm}_S(\\mathcal L)&amp;\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{n\\in\\omega}T_n,\\\\\nE_0&amp;\\coloneqq\\{t\\doteq u\\mid t,u\\in\\mathrm{Trm}_S(\\mathcal L)\\}\n\\cup\\{R(\\vec t)\\mid R\\in P,\\ k=a_P(R),\\ \\vec t\\in\\mathrm{Trm}_S(\\mathcal L)^k\\},\\\\\nE_{n+1}&amp;\\coloneqq E_n\\cup\\{\\neg A,A\\lor B,\\forall x A\\mid A,B\\in E_n,\\ x\\in\\mathsf V\\},\\quad\n\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\mathcal L)\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{n\\in\\omega}E_n,\\\\\nA\\land B&amp;\\coloneqq\\neg(\\neg A\\lor\\neg B),\\quad A\\to B\\coloneqq\\neg A\\lor B,\\quad\nA\\leftrightarrow B\\coloneqq(A\\to B)\\land(B\\to A),\\quad\\exists x A\\coloneqq\\neg\\forall x\\neg A,\\\\\n\\mathrm{FV}(x)&amp;\\coloneqq\\{x\\},\\quad \\mathrm{FV}(c)\\coloneqq\\varnothing,\\quad\n\\mathrm{FV}(f(\\vec t))\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{i&lt;|\\vec t|}\\mathrm{FV}(t_i),\\\\\n\\mathrm{FV}(t\\doteq u)&amp;\\coloneqq\\mathrm{FV}(t)\\cup\\mathrm{FV}(u),\\quad\n\\mathrm{FV}(P(\\vec t))\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{i&lt;|\\vec t|}\\mathrm{FV}(t_i),\\\\\n\\mathrm{FV}(\\neg A)&amp;\\coloneqq\\mathrm{FV}(A),\\quad\\mathrm{FV}(A\\lor B)\\coloneqq\\mathrm{FV}(A)\\cup\\mathrm{FV}(B),\\quad\n\\mathrm{FV}(\\forall x A)\\coloneqq\\mathrm{FV}(A)\\setminus\\{x\\},\\\\\n\\mathsf{AV}(t)&amp;\\coloneqq\\mathrm{FV}(t),\\quad\n\\mathsf{AV}(t\\doteq u)\\coloneqq\\mathrm{FV}(t)\\cup\\mathrm{FV}(u),\\quad\n\\mathsf{AV}(P(\\vec t))\\coloneqq\\bigcup_i\\mathrm{FV}(t_i),\\\\\n\\mathsf{AV}(\\neg A)&amp;\\coloneqq\\mathsf{AV}(A),\\quad\n\\mathsf{AV}(A\\lor B)\\coloneqq\\mathsf{AV}(A)\\cup\\mathsf{AV}(B),\\quad\n\\mathsf{AV}(\\forall x A)\\coloneqq\\mathsf{AV}(A)\\cup\\{x\\},\\\\\nx\\rho&amp;\\coloneqq\\rho(x),\\quad c\\rho\\coloneqq c,\\quad\nf(\\vec t)\\rho\\coloneqq f(\\langle t_i\\rho\\mid i&lt;|\\vec t|\\rangle),\\\\\n(t\\doteq u)\\rho&amp;\\coloneqq(t\\rho\\doteq u\\rho),\\quad\nP(\\vec t)\\rho\\coloneqq P(\\langle t_i\\rho\\mid i&lt;|\\vec t|\\rangle),\\\\\n(\\neg A)\\rho&amp;\\coloneqq\\neg(A\\rho),\\quad(A\\lor B)\\rho\\coloneqq A\\rho\\lor B\\rho,\\\\\nU(A,x,\\rho)&amp;\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{z\\in\\mathrm{FV}(A)\\setminus\\{x\\}}\\mathrm{FV}(\\rho(z)),\\\\\nz(A,x,\\rho)&amp;\\coloneqq v_{\\min\\{i\\in\\omega\\mid v_i\\notin\\mathsf{AV}(A)\\cup U(A,x,\\rho)\\cup\\{x\\}\\}},\\\\\n(\\forall x A)\\rho&amp;\\coloneqq\n\\begin{cases}\n\\forall x\\,(A\\rho[x\\mapsto x]),&amp;x\\notin U(A,x,\\rho),\\\\\n\\forall z(A,x,\\rho)\\,(A\\rho[x\\mapsto z(A,x,\\rho)]),&amp;x\\in U(A,x,\\rho),\n\\end{cases}\\\\\nA[\\vec x:=\\vec t]&amp;\\coloneqq A\\rho_{\\vec x,\\vec t},\\quad\n\\rho_{\\vec x,\\vec t}(v)\\coloneqq\n\\begin{cases}t_i,&amp;v=x_i,\\ i&lt;|\\vec x|,\\\\v,&amp;v\\notin\\operatorname{ran}(\\vec x),\\end{cases}\\\\\n\\mathrm{ucl}(A)&amp;\\coloneqq\\forall v_{i_0}\\cdots\\forall v_{i_{k-1}}A\n\\quad(\\mathrm{FV}(A)=\\{v_{i_0},\\ldots,v_{i_{k-1}}\\},\\ i_0&lt;\\cdots&lt;i_{k-1}),\\\\\n\\mathrm{Sent}_S(\\mathcal L)&amp;\\coloneqq\\{A\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\mathcal L)\\mid\\mathrm{FV}(A)=\\varnothing\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}first\\text{-}order\\text{-}formula}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\nT_0&amp;\\coloneqq\\mathsf V\\cup C,\\quad\nT_{n+1}\\coloneqq T_n\\cup\\{f(t_0,\\ldots,t_{k-1})\\mid f\\in F,\\ k=a_F(f),\\ \\vec t\\in T_n^k\\},\\\\\n\\mathrm{Trm}_S(\\mathcal L)&amp;\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{n\\in\\omega}T_n,\\\\\nE_0&amp;\\coloneqq\\{t\\doteq u\\mid t,u\\in\\mathrm{Trm}_S(\\mathcal L)\\}\n\\cup\\{R(\\vec t)\\mid R\\in P,\\ k=a_P(R),\\ \\vec t\\in\\mathrm{Trm}_S(\\mathcal L)^k\\},\\\\\nE_{n+1}&amp;\\coloneqq E_n\\cup\\{\\neg A,A\\lor B,\\forall x A\\mid A,B\\in E_n,\\ x\\in\\mathsf V\\},\\quad\n\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\mathcal L)\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{n\\in\\omega}E_n,\\\\\nA\\land B&amp;\\coloneqq\\neg(\\neg A\\lor\\neg B),\\quad A\\to B\\coloneqq\\neg A\\lor B,\\quad\nA\\leftrightarrow B\\coloneqq(A\\to B)\\land(B\\to A),\\quad\\exists x A\\coloneqq\\neg\\forall x\\neg A,\\\\\n\\mathrm{FV}(x)&amp;\\coloneqq\\{x\\},\\quad \\mathrm{FV}(c)\\coloneqq\\varnothing,\\quad\n\\mathrm{FV}(f(\\vec t))\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{i&lt;|\\vec t|}\\mathrm{FV}(t_i),\\\\\n\\mathrm{FV}(t\\doteq u)&amp;\\coloneqq\\mathrm{FV}(t)\\cup\\mathrm{FV}(u),\\quad\n\\mathrm{FV}(P(\\vec t))\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{i&lt;|\\vec t|}\\mathrm{FV}(t_i),\\\\\n\\mathrm{FV}(\\neg A)&amp;\\coloneqq\\mathrm{FV}(A),\\quad\\mathrm{FV}(A\\lor B)\\coloneqq\\mathrm{FV}(A)\\cup\\mathrm{FV}(B),\\quad\n\\mathrm{FV}(\\forall x A)\\coloneqq\\mathrm{FV}(A)\\setminus\\{x\\},\\\\\n\\mathsf{AV}(t)&amp;\\coloneqq\\mathrm{FV}(t),\\quad\n\\mathsf{AV}(t\\doteq u)\\coloneqq\\mathrm{FV}(t)\\cup\\mathrm{FV}(u),\\quad\n\\mathsf{AV}(P(\\vec t))\\coloneqq\\bigcup_i\\mathrm{FV}(t_i),\\\\\n\\mathsf{AV}(\\neg A)&amp;\\coloneqq\\mathsf{AV}(A),\\quad\n\\mathsf{AV}(A\\lor B)\\coloneqq\\mathsf{AV}(A)\\cup\\mathsf{AV}(B),\\quad\n\\mathsf{AV}(\\forall x A)\\coloneqq\\mathsf{AV}(A)\\cup\\{x\\},\\\\\nx\\rho&amp;\\coloneqq\\rho(x),\\quad c\\rho\\coloneqq c,\\quad\nf(\\vec t)\\rho\\coloneqq f(\\langle t_i\\rho\\mid i&lt;|\\vec t|\\rangle),\\\\\n(t\\doteq u)\\rho&amp;\\coloneqq(t\\rho\\doteq u\\rho),\\quad\nP(\\vec t)\\rho\\coloneqq P(\\langle t_i\\rho\\mid i&lt;|\\vec t|\\rangle),\\\\\n(\\neg A)\\rho&amp;\\coloneqq\\neg(A\\rho),\\quad(A\\lor B)\\rho\\coloneqq A\\rho\\lor B\\rho,\\\\\nU(A,x,\\rho)&amp;\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{z\\in\\mathrm{FV}(A)\\setminus\\{x\\}}\\mathrm{FV}(\\rho(z)),\\\\\nz(A,x,\\rho)&amp;\\coloneqq v_{\\min\\{i\\in\\omega\\mid v_i\\notin\\mathsf{AV}(A)\\cup U(A,x,\\rho)\\cup\\{x\\}\\}},\\\\\n(\\forall x A)\\rho&amp;\\coloneqq\n\\begin{cases}\n\\forall x\\,(A\\rho[x\\mapsto x]),&amp;x\\notin U(A,x,\\rho),\\\\\n\\forall z(A,x,\\rho)\\,(A\\rho[x\\mapsto z(A,x,\\rho)]),&amp;x\\in U(A,x,\\rho),\n\\end{cases}\\\\\nA[\\vec x:=\\vec t]&amp;\\coloneqq A\\rho_{\\vec x,\\vec t},\\quad\n\\rho_{\\vec x,\\vec t}(v)\\coloneqq\n\\begin{cases}t_i,&amp;v=x_i,\\ i&lt;|\\vec x|,\\\\v,&amp;v\\notin\\operatorname{ran}(\\vec x),\\end{cases}\\\\\n\\mathrm{ucl}(A)&amp;\\coloneqq\\forall v_{i_0}\\cdots\\forall v_{i_{k-1}}A\n\\quad(\\mathrm{FV}(A)=\\{v_{i_0},\\ldots,v_{i_{k-1}}\\},\\ i_0&lt;\\cdots&lt;i_{k-1}),\\\\\n\\mathrm{Sent}_S(\\mathcal L)&amp;\\coloneqq\\{A\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\mathcal L)\\mid\\mathrm{FV}(A)=\\varnothing\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{ind}(v_i)&amp;\\coloneqq i,\\\\\n\\mathsf{Fresh}(U,0)&amp;\\coloneqq\\langle\\rangle,\\\\\n\\mathsf{Fresh}(U,k+1)&amp;\\coloneqq\\mathsf{Fresh}(U,k)\\mathbin{\\frown}\n\\left\\langle v_{\\min\\{i\\in\\omega\\mid v_i\\notin U\\cup\\operatorname{ran}(\\mathsf{Fresh}(U,k))\\}}\\right\\rangle\n\\quad(U\\in\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathsf V),\\ k\\in\\omega),\\\\\n\\mathsf{FreeList}(A)&amp;\\coloneqq\n\\langle v_{s_j}\\mid j&lt;|s|\\rangle\\quad\n\\left(s=\\operatorname{inc}(\\{i\\in\\omega\\mid v_i\\in\\mathrm{FV}(A)\\})\\right),\\\\\n\\mathsf{Fold}_Q(\\langle\\rangle,A)&amp;\\coloneqq A,\\quad\n\\mathsf{Fold}_Q(\\langle x\\rangle\\mathbin{\\frown}s,A)\\coloneqq Qx\\,\\mathsf{Fold}_Q(s,A)\n\\quad(Q\\in\\{\\forall,\\exists\\}),\\\\\nQ\\vec x\\,A&amp;\\coloneqq\\mathsf{Fold}_Q(\\vec x,A),\\quad\n\\mathrm{ucl}(A)=\\mathsf{Fold}_{\\forall}(\\mathsf{FreeList}(A),A),\\\\\nE[x:=t]&amp;\\coloneqq E\\rho_{\\langle x\\rangle,\\langle t\\rangle},\\quad\nE[t/x]\\coloneqq E[x:=t],\\\\\nE[x_0:=t_0,\\ldots,x_{k-1}:=t_{k-1}]&amp;\\coloneqq E\\rho_{\\vec x,\\vec t}\n\\quad\\left(E\\in\\mathrm{Trm}_S(\\mathcal L)\\cup\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\mathcal L)\\right),\\\\\n\\mathsf{Inst}_{\\vec x}(A;\\vec t)&amp;\\coloneqq A[\\vec x:=\\vec t]\n\\quad\\left(\\mathrm{FV}(A)\\subseteq\\operatorname{ran}(\\vec x)\\right),\\\\\n\\exists!x\\,A&amp;\\coloneqq\\exists x\\left(A\\land\\forall z\\left(A[x:=z]\\to z=x\\right)\\right),\\quad\nz\\coloneqq\\mathsf{Fresh}(\\mathsf{AV}(A)\\cup\\{x\\},1)_0.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{ind}(v_i)&amp;\\coloneqq i,\\\\\n\\mathsf{Fresh}(U,0)&amp;\\coloneqq\\langle\\rangle,\\\\\n\\mathsf{Fresh}(U,k+1)&amp;\\coloneqq\\mathsf{Fresh}(U,k)\\mathbin{\\frown}\n\\left\\langle v_{\\min\\{i\\in\\omega\\mid v_i\\notin U\\cup\\operatorname{ran}(\\mathsf{Fresh}(U,k))\\}}\\right\\rangle\n\\quad(U\\in\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathsf V),\\ k\\in\\omega),\\\\\n\\mathsf{FreeList}(A)&amp;\\coloneqq\n\\langle v_{s_j}\\mid j&lt;|s|\\rangle\\quad\n\\left(s=\\operatorname{inc}(\\{i\\in\\omega\\mid v_i\\in\\mathrm{FV}(A)\\})\\right),\\\\\n\\mathsf{Fold}_Q(\\langle\\rangle,A)&amp;\\coloneqq A,\\quad\n\\mathsf{Fold}_Q(\\langle x\\rangle\\mathbin{\\frown}s,A)\\coloneqq Qx\\,\\mathsf{Fold}_Q(s,A)\n\\quad(Q\\in\\{\\forall,\\exists\\}),\\\\\nQ\\vec x\\,A&amp;\\coloneqq\\mathsf{Fold}_Q(\\vec x,A),\\quad\n\\mathrm{ucl}(A)=\\mathsf{Fold}_{\\forall}(\\mathsf{FreeList}(A),A),\\\\\nE[x:=t]&amp;\\coloneqq E\\rho_{\\langle x\\rangle,\\langle t\\rangle},\\quad\nE[t/x]\\coloneqq E[x:=t],\\\\\nE[x_0:=t_0,\\ldots,x_{k-1}:=t_{k-1}]&amp;\\coloneqq E\\rho_{\\vec x,\\vec t}\n\\quad\\left(E\\in\\mathrm{Trm}_S(\\mathcal L)\\cup\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\mathcal L)\\right),\\\\\n\\mathsf{Inst}_{\\vec x}(A;\\vec t)&amp;\\coloneqq A[\\vec x:=\\vec t]\n\\quad\\left(\\mathrm{FV}(A)\\subseteq\\operatorname{ran}(\\vec x)\\right),\\\\\n\\exists!x\\,A&amp;\\coloneqq\\exists x\\left(A\\land\\forall z\\left(A[x:=z]\\to z=x\\right)\\right),\\quad\nz\\coloneqq\\mathsf{Fresh}(\\mathsf{AV}(A)\\cup\\{x\\},1)_0.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>保留原算术文件使用的 ¬、∨、∀ 原始构造；经典缩写不是另加互相独立的构造子。替换递归在量词处更新映射，只递归到原来的直接子公式，故不存在先反复改名再替换导致的循环。向量替换要求变量互异且两向量等长。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"89-df-function","status":"resolved","id":"0d71e87a2f416230","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-function]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-omega","status":"resolved","id":"7ad117274f74965a","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-omega]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathcal L=(C,F,a_F,P,a_P)","display":false},{"tex":"a_F:F\\to\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"a_P:P\\to\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"C,F,P","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf V=\\{v_i\\mid i\\in\\omega\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\neg,\\lor,\\forall","display":false},{"tex":"\\rho:\\mathsf V\\to\\mathrm{Trm}_S(\\mathcal L)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf{AV}","display":false},{"tex":"\\rho[x\\mapsto t]","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf V","display":false},{"tex":"|\\vec x|=|\\vec t|","display":false},{"tex":"\\vec x","display":false},{"tex":"U","display":false},{"tex":"k\\in\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\vec x","display":false},{"tex":"\\vec t","display":false},{"tex":"E[t/x]","display":false},{"tex":"E[x:=t]","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}first\\text{-}order\\text{-}formula}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\nT_0&\\coloneqq\\mathsf V\\cup C,\\quad\nT_{n+1}\\coloneqq T_n\\cup\\{f(t_0,\\ldots,t_{k-1})\\mid f\\in F,\\ k=a_F(f),\\ \\vec t\\in T_n^k\\},\\\\\n\\mathrm{Trm}_S(\\mathcal L)&\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{n\\in\\omega}T_n,\\\\\nE_0&\\coloneqq\\{t\\doteq u\\mid t,u\\in\\mathrm{Trm}_S(\\mathcal L)\\}\n\\cup\\{R(\\vec t)\\mid R\\in P,\\ k=a_P(R),\\ \\vec t\\in\\mathrm{Trm}_S(\\mathcal L)^k\\},\\\\\nE_{n+1}&\\coloneqq E_n\\cup\\{\\neg A,A\\lor B,\\forall x A\\mid A,B\\in E_n,\\ x\\in\\mathsf V\\},\\quad\n\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\mathcal L)\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{n\\in\\omega}E_n,\\\\\nA\\land B&\\coloneqq\\neg(\\neg A\\lor\\neg B),\\quad A\\to B\\coloneqq\\neg A\\lor B,\\quad\nA\\leftrightarrow B\\coloneqq(A\\to B)\\land(B\\to A),\\quad\\exists x A\\coloneqq\\neg\\forall x\\neg A,\\\\\n\\mathrm{FV}(x)&\\coloneqq\\{x\\},\\quad \\mathrm{FV}(c)\\coloneqq\\varnothing,\\quad\n\\mathrm{FV}(f(\\vec t))\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{i<|\\vec t|}\\mathrm{FV}(t_i),\\\\\n\\mathrm{FV}(t\\doteq u)&\\coloneqq\\mathrm{FV}(t)\\cup\\mathrm{FV}(u),\\quad\n\\mathrm{FV}(P(\\vec t))\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{i<|\\vec t|}\\mathrm{FV}(t_i),\\\\\n\\mathrm{FV}(\\neg A)&\\coloneqq\\mathrm{FV}(A),\\quad\\mathrm{FV}(A\\lor B)\\coloneqq\\mathrm{FV}(A)\\cup\\mathrm{FV}(B),\\quad\n\\mathrm{FV}(\\forall x A)\\coloneqq\\mathrm{FV}(A)\\setminus\\{x\\},\\\\\n\\mathsf{AV}(t)&\\coloneqq\\mathrm{FV}(t),\\quad\n\\mathsf{AV}(t\\doteq u)\\coloneqq\\mathrm{FV}(t)\\cup\\mathrm{FV}(u),\\quad\n\\mathsf{AV}(P(\\vec t))\\coloneqq\\bigcup_i\\mathrm{FV}(t_i),\\\\\n\\mathsf{AV}(\\neg A)&\\coloneqq\\mathsf{AV}(A),\\quad\n\\mathsf{AV}(A\\lor B)\\coloneqq\\mathsf{AV}(A)\\cup\\mathsf{AV}(B),\\quad\n\\mathsf{AV}(\\forall x A)\\coloneqq\\mathsf{AV}(A)\\cup\\{x\\},\\\\\nx\\rho&\\coloneqq\\rho(x),\\quad c\\rho\\coloneqq c,\\quad\nf(\\vec t)\\rho\\coloneqq f(\\langle t_i\\rho\\mid i<|\\vec t|\\rangle),\\\\\n(t\\doteq u)\\rho&\\coloneqq(t\\rho\\doteq u\\rho),\\quad\nP(\\vec t)\\rho\\coloneqq P(\\langle t_i\\rho\\mid i<|\\vec t|\\rangle),\\\\\n(\\neg A)\\rho&\\coloneqq\\neg(A\\rho),\\quad(A\\lor B)\\rho\\coloneqq A\\rho\\lor B\\rho,\\\\\nU(A,x,\\rho)&\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{z\\in\\mathrm{FV}(A)\\setminus\\{x\\}}\\mathrm{FV}(\\rho(z)),\\\\\nz(A,x,\\rho)&\\coloneqq v_{\\min\\{i\\in\\omega\\mid v_i\\notin\\mathsf{AV}(A)\\cup U(A,x,\\rho)\\cup\\{x\\}\\}},\\\\\n(\\forall x A)\\rho&\\coloneqq\n\\begin{cases}\n\\forall x\\,(A\\rho[x\\mapsto x]),&x\\notin U(A,x,\\rho),\\\\\n\\forall z(A,x,\\rho)\\,(A\\rho[x\\mapsto z(A,x,\\rho)]),&x\\in U(A,x,\\rho),\n\\end{cases}\\\\\nA[\\vec x:=\\vec t]&\\coloneqq A\\rho_{\\vec x,\\vec t},\\quad\n\\rho_{\\vec x,\\vec t}(v)\\coloneqq\n\\begin{cases}t_i,&v=x_i,\\ i<|\\vec x|,\\\\v,&v\\notin\\operatorname{ran}(\\vec x),\\end{cases}\\\\\n\\mathrm{ucl}(A)&\\coloneqq\\forall v_{i_0}\\cdots\\forall v_{i_{k-1}}A\n\\quad(\\mathrm{FV}(A)=\\{v_{i_0},\\ldots,v_{i_{k-1}}\\},\\ i_0<\\cdots<i_{k-1}),\\\\\n\\mathrm{Sent}_S(\\mathcal L)&\\coloneqq\\{A\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\mathcal L)\\mid\\mathrm{FV}(A)=\\varnothing\\}.\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{ind}(v_i)&\\coloneqq i,\\\\\n\\mathsf{Fresh}(U,0)&\\coloneqq\\langle\\rangle,\\\\\n\\mathsf{Fresh}(U,k+1)&\